# Issue Rework Request: I07-1 Coboundary Recovery

## 1. Human Feedback & Critique
The previous construction of Layer 4 was based on a simplified linear functional definition rather than the correct superalgebra coboundary operator $\delta f$ for an odd map $f$. This resulted in an incorrect algebraic structure that cannot be used for triviality testing.

## 2. AI Correction Plan
- Replace the current coboundary logic in `src/C_coboundary_generator.py` with an implementation of the coboundary operator formula: 
  $(\delta f)(X, Y) = (-1)^{p(X)}[X, f(Y)] - (-1)^{(p(X)+1)p(Y)}[Y, f(X)] - f([X, Y])$.
- Define an odd map $f$ that reverses parity.
- Re-calculate the coboundary coefficients for all generator pairs $(X, Y)$ using the standard Lie superbracket structure constants (Layer 1).
- Re-generate `C_n_coboundary.json` files.

